            "steam_appid": 276430,
            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/276430/extras/8bdacf41c6e407da76beac0316d553d5.avif?t=1660112224\" width=616 height=80 /></span><br><br>A lot of exciting tasks and different pets are waiting for you! You will be in charge of caring for each little fosterling personally. The playful little pets will need a lot of attention when running around lumbering. Teach your animals tricks and pamper them with nice treats. When having achieved a task very well you will get “extras” to upgrade your pet hotel to lead your pet hotel to worldclass success!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>15 new and individual missions to accomplish <br></li><li>Various opportunities for individual interaction with animals <br></li><li>Highly detailed graphics of pets, objects, setting and movements</li></ul>",
